            "content": "<p><strong>Returns are 100% free<br/><br/></strong>You have <strong>90 days</strong> to let us know if it's not to be<strong> </strong>from the day you receive your order. We’ll even handle the collection of your order for you, making returning your William Wood purchase an effortless process.</p>"
